@host = http://localhost:8080

### Tool question: trace has retrieve, chat, execute_tool getTodaysSpecial, chat. Paste traceId into Grafana (localhost:3000) → Explore → Tempo
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What's today's special?"
}

### Knowledge-base question: trace has retrieve and a single chat span
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Until what time is breakfast served, and how much is a flat white?"
}

### Not in the knowledge base: the model should say it doesn't know
POST {{host}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Do you have parking?"
}

### Token usage per model call (exists after the first successful /ask)
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/gen_ai.client.token.usage?tag=gen_ai.token.type:input

### Tool duration timer, tagged by tool name and outcome
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/langchain4j.tool

### AI Service duration timer
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/langchain4j.ai_service
